409
00:28:11.650 --> 00:28:12.901
It's on me. I'm sorry.

410
00:28:14.778 --> 00:28:17.029
I know it hasn't been fair. but...

411
00:28:17.030 --> 00:28:18.490
What's all this about memories?

412
00:28:20.117 --> 00:28:22.159
Wh-Why do you...
