427
00:29:19.593 --> 00:29:21.011
but lower and slower...

428
00:29:24.097 --> 00:29:27.392
so we don't realize
what's happening until it's too late.

429
00:29:31.730 --> 00:29:34.316
To save the lives of everyone in the Silo.

430
00:29:35.609 --> 00:29:36.860
Yours. mine...

431
